-without-traversal-using-opaque" class="group flex items-start break-words py-1 pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] whitespace-pre-wrap focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 text-gray-500 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-400 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light">Resolve without traversal using opaque</a></li></ul></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:0rem" href="#task-composition-within-flows" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 font-medium dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">Task composition within flows</a></li><li class="toc-item relative" data-depth="0"><a style="--toc-padding-left:0rem" href="#background-tasks" class="break-words py-1 block pl-[calc(var(--toc-padding-left)+var(--toc-focus-padding,0rem))] focus-visible:[--toc-focus-padding:0.25rem] focus-visible:-ml-1 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 font-medium dark:text-gray-400 [li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-900 dark:[li:not([data-active])&gt;&amp;:hover]:text-gray-300 [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary dark:[[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:text-primary-light [[data-active]&gt;&amp;]:[text-shadow:-0.15px_0_0_currentColor,0.15px_0_0_currentColor]">Background tasks</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative grow box-border flex-col w-full mx-auto px-1 lg:pl-[5.7rem] lg:-ml-12 xl:w-[ca